						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 4: PIANO MODE\n\nIn this example we've set the Bool In node to piano mode.\nThis means that the returned value is true for as long as the input button is pressed.\nIn turn, this allows us to create expressive patches like this, that build up over time."
