					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: BYPASSING A LAYER\n\nHere we are using the Bool In node to enable a Video Mixer layer.\nEven though the Video Mixer's opacity parameter wants a Float, we can still feed it a bool.\nTrue will be 1.0 and false will be 0.0.\n\nBut what if you want to reverse the functionality of the boolean?\nUse the NOT node to turn a True to False and a False to True.\nGive it a try, insert a NOT node in between the Bool In and Video Mixer."
					}
				},
